{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — They sought the first; they shall go into exile at the head." "<b>marzeach</b> — Like the word רנה for making sound heard, as in 'Do not enter the house of marzeach.' And the marzeach is the song, and when the punishment comes then the song shall depart." "<b>sruhim</b> — From: הסרוחים על ערשותם (the lolling ones upon their couches)."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:19.608169230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}